<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Nov 18.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Nov 18.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Mangalore port on November 18:</p>
<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Scrap		 1,034 (ULD) 11,399    Beta Luck	  7/11</p>
<p> Limestone	   5,310 (ULD) 11,789    Jag Vasant	15/11</p>
<p> Timber		3,619 (ULD)  2,957    Wood Pecker     10/11</p>
<p> Granite	     2,991 (LDD)  3,009    Vigo Express    16/11</p>
<p> Timber		  343 (ULD)    191    Asian Ruby II   15/11</p>
<p> Benzene		 970 (ULD)    ---    Hun Jian	  18/11</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>ULD-Discharge</p>
<p>LDD-Loading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Mangalore)</p>
